bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    native_build_absolute_entry_zero_sources_2026-11-12, 0, "2026-11-12 OPEN. native-build with an absolute entry path containing /test/ (also /tests/, /testdata/, /verification/) fails 'collected zero source files'; the relative spelling works. Cause: driver_entry_closure_core.spl:1956 packaging filter applied to the root entry because driver_source_pipeline_loading.spl:920 picks _driver_collect_entry_import_source when the entry came via SIMPLE_NATIVE_BUILD_ENTRY. Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/native_build_absolute_entry_zero_sources_2026-11-12.md."

